Launched **EffNet-B4 (`tf_efficientnet_b4.ns_jft_in1k`) @384, bs48, lr4e-4, label_smooth0.1, 12 epochs, 5 folds, hflip+vflip TTA** → `workspaces/rigel_tau/train.py`.
