- Per-class recall: CBB 0.642 · CBSD 0.785 · CGM 0.786 · **CMD 0.971** · Healthy 0.746.
- Bagged test probs (mean of 5 folds) → `workspaces/rigel_tau/oof/test_probs_effb4_384_f*.npy` (also emitted `candidates/submission_effb4_5fold.csv`). Pred dist `[152,265,274,1668,317]`.
